"Get started" = "开始使用";
"Vibe Buddy turns what Codex and Claude Code are doing into pictures and sounds on the box." = "Vibe Buddy 把 Codex 和 Claude Code 的状态变成盒子上的画面和声音。";
"Next: plug in the box, connect your agents, pick an announcement voice, and choose whether to launch at login. Everything can be changed or skipped." = "接下来几步：插上盒子，接入 Agent，挑一个播报音色，决定要不要开机就启动。都能改，都能跳过。";
