"Flashing Vibe Buddy firmware…" = "正在刷入 Vibe Buddy 固件…";
"Hold K0 on the box and replug the cable to put it in download mode, then retry." = "按住盒子的 K0 再插一次线，让它进入下载模式，然后重试。";
"The box screen stays dark for a few minutes — don't unplug it. It restarts on its own when done, and this page will show it as found." = "盒子屏幕会黑几分钟，别拔线。刷完它自动重启，这里会变成「找到了」。";
