"This build has no bundled firmware, so it can't flash the box." = "这个构建没有附带固件，没法刷入。";
"This erases the box's current firmware and data for good. If the native USB port doesn't find the box, use its UART port instead." = "会清掉盒子里现有的固件与数据，无法恢复。原生 USB 口找不到盒子时，改接盒子的 UART 口。";
