"Make it blink" = "让它眨一下眼";
"If the backlight flashes, that's the one." = "盒子背光闪了就是它。";
"Not showing up? Use a cable that carries data, not just power, and click Allow if macOS asks whether to let the accessory connect." = "没出现？换一根能传数据的线（有的线只能充电），macOS 问是否允许配件连接时点「允许」。";
